  "song_id": 1439,
  "title": "The Fine Print",
  "language": "en",
  "lyricists": [
    70
  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Render unto Geedorah what is Geedorah's",
          "rhyme": "ins",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Ten to one he sees ya through a beaker and a tweezers",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Read the fine print and be like, \"What's the big deal?\"",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Spun wheels of steel since broke wheel Big Wheel",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Back when it was greasy S-curl, now it's easy dread",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Had a rhyme on how they used to tease him 'bout his peasy head",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Yes-yes-y'all to the beat, have it bald or Avacor",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Have it your way, or grab a straw, Jabberjaw",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Since two tone Lee's, these new phonies is boney ho's",
          "rhyme": "ins",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Lonely, like cheese and bologny only",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "I could've broke my sacroiliac",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Silly grind, Billy Jack, illy nine, milli black",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Or listen to it go \"bang!\" Through and through a Kangol",
          "rhyme": "Ol",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "A strange combination of a king who teach slang flow",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Two-thirds slow, one-third amazing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Wonder words, fine sponsor of this Thunderbird occasion",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "And have an iller rhyme, at least by Miller Time",
          "rhyme": "ajm",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Collect the skrilla and geese with a killer dime",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Met her out in Killa Queens, originally she from the Philippines",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "I love the way she fill her jeans",
          "rhyme": "ins",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Still a teen and made for strange bedfellows",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Okay, so it's head to elbows for shell-toes",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Uh-oh, heads up! There she blows",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "A whole load of Head & Shoulders, and who care where she goes",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Let the music take control",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Just don't let the evildoers abuse it and use it to take your soul",
          "rhyme": "ul",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "It's like putting fire to fake gold, it turn colors",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "And get duller than a bake roll with no butter",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "The shutter of a cake hole",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Who break drakes 'til it get old and flake mold",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Cornball, have 'em seeing white stars, I warned y'all",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Like getting hit with a bottle of Mo' from Sean Paul",
          "rhyme": "Ol",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "\"He not white\" ... Oh, he mad light though",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Either which way, they not ready for the lightning show",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "They can't scandalize mine",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "You could ask a swine who can't stands when I shine",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Geedorah the professor add a question to the lessons",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "He suggest you get a full assessment instead of guessing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "It's too stressing, did he stutter like rookie yes-men?",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Or did he just bring the butter, like the cookie chessmen",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "This just in: they ain't even worth the worry",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "Lying on their first birth, and couldn't even hurt a Smurf-berry",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "Hear ye, hear ye! How dare ye",
          "rhyme": "Ej",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "Go up against the King who do his thing tri-yearly?",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "They too carefree with their mouth around here",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "Off with his head and display it at Town Square",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "On top a seven-feet spike, make sure it's on tight",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "In light of when the peasants throw stones with all their might",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "48",
          "text": "Skull get smashed for weeks",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "49",
          "text": "'Til vulture beaks eats the last meat off the cheeks",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "50",
          "text": "Maybe then they'll know the right words to speak",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "51",
          "text": "Out loud, at home, in the world, or in the streets",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "52",
          "text": "There's no escape, just in case",
          "rhyme": "az",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "53",
          "text": "All the King's mens and 'em decides to go apes",
          "rhyme": "ap",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "54",
          "text": "The most slick-talking of burly guys",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "55",
          "text": "Get caught early and boiled in oil like curly fries",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "56",
          "text": "Even those that's Mr. Furley's size that earned the fate",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "57",
          "text": "Can all get burned at the stake",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "58",
          "text": "Send word to his closest kins, that for his sins",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "59",
          "text": "We claim his throne, his providence, and its citizens",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "60",
          "text": "In the name of King Geedorah!...",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "61",
          "text": "Don't make him catch a seizure",
          "rhyme": "yR",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEEFGAHIIJGKLMNOAGPGPQRFSQTQJUGOOLKVVHHWHXYZZ[[\\]^_`HabcVde",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABABBBCDAAEECDAFEAAADADADGCHDCDCCDAAFABBAABAHEEEAABAEEBAEBIBEJ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "outro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "\"We regret that you have not yet complied with our order",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "We interpret this as a negative reply",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "We are prepared therefore to conquer the Earth\"",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "\"We have stationed King Geedorah in the Western Hemisphere",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Geedorah was always one of their weapons",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And King Geedorah is completely controlled by our computers through magnetic waves\"",
          "rhyme": "av",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "\"Are you a homo? (Like the others)",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "We help thousands of homos every month!\"",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "\"All I’m saying right…",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Is in the old days right..",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "The women knew who the women were",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "The men knew who the men were",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "The women knew who the men were",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "And the men knew who the women were.\"",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "\"I'm here to tell you that the future of your planet is at stake",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I urge that you transmit that message to the nations of the Earth\"",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "\"Now do you feel like telling me where your leader is?\"",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "King_Geedorah"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFGCHHDDDDICJ",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCADCECCCAAAAFCF"
    }
  ]
